<link rel="preload" as="image" href="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1520052203542-d3095f1b6cf0?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=crop&amp;fm=jpg&amp;q=88&amp;w=1400"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1530507629858-e4977d30e9e0?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=crop&amp;fm=jpg&amp;q=85&amp;w=900"/><div class="landing"><nav class="public-nav"><div class="logo "><span class="logo-mark"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 4C12 4 5 8 5 15c0 3 2 5 5 5 7 0 10-8 10-16Z"></path><path d="M4 21c3-6 7-9 12-12"></path></svg></span><span>Tani<span>Hubungan</span></span></div><div class="nav-links"><a href="#harga">Harga Komoditas</a><a href="#fitur">Cara Kerja</a><a href="#keamanan">Keamanan</a></div><div class="nav-actions"><button class="btn text">Masuk</button><button class="btn primary">Daftar Sekarang</button></div></nav><main><section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span></span> Tumbuh dan terhubung bersama</div><h1>Harga Transparan,<br/>Panen Terhubung <em>ke Pembeli</em></h1><p>Akses informasi harga pasar yang terpercaya dan temukan pembeli lokal untuk hasil panen Anda, tanpa perantara yang rumit.</p><div class="hero-actions"><button type="button" class="btn primary large" data-register-role="Petani"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 4C12 4 5 8 5 15c0 3 2 5 5 5 7 0 10-8 10-16Z"></path><path d="M4 21c3-6 7-9 12-12"></path></svg> Daftar sebagai Petani</button><button type="button" class="btn secondary large" data-register-role="Pembeli"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m4 10 2 10h12l2-10H4Z"></path><path d="m9 10 3-6 3 6M3 10h18"></path></svg> Daftar sebagai Pembeli</button></div><div class="trust-row"><span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"></path></svg> Gratis untuk bergabung</span><span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"></path></svg> Data terverifikasi</span></div></div><div class="hero-visual"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1520052203542-d3095f1b6cf0?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=crop&amp;fm=jpg&amp;q=88&amp;w=1400" alt="Petani merawat sawah di Indonesia"/><div class="floating-price"><p class="empty-state" style="padding:24px;text-align:center">Data harga belum tersedia.</p></div><div class="verified-chip"><span><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-3 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 7 8 10 8 10Z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-5"></path></svg></span><div><b>Petani terverifikasi</b><small>Aman untuk bertransaksi</small></div></div></div></section><section class="stats-strip"><p class="empty-state" style="grid-column:1/-1;text-align:center;padding:24px">Statistik akan tampil setelah data tersedia.</p></section><section id="fitur" class="section"><div class="section-heading"><span class="kicker">FITUR UTAMA</span><h2>Satu tempat untuk panen yang lebih menguntungkan</h2><p>Informasi yang jelas dan koneksi yang tepat untuk membantu keputusan usaha tani Anda.</p></div><div class="feature-grid"><article class="feature-card"><span class="feature-no">01</span><div class="feature-icon"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13 13 20 4 11V4h7l9 9Z"></path><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1"></circle></svg></div><h3>Informasi Harga Komoditas</h3><p>Bandingkan harga berdasarkan komoditas, pasar, tanggal, dan sumber data yang jelas.</p><a>Pelajari selengkapnya <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M14 7l5 5-5 5"></path></svg></a></article><article class="feature-card"><span class="feature-no">02</span><div class="feature-icon"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21V4M12 7c-4 0-5-3-5-4 4 0 5 3 5 4ZM12 11c4 0 5-3 5-4-4 0-5 3-5 4ZM12 15c-4 0-5-3-5-4 4 0 5 3 5 4Z"></path></svg></div><h3>Papan Penawaran Hasil Panen</h3><p>Catat komoditas, jumlah, dan perkiraan waktu panen agar mudah ditemukan pembeli.</p><a>Pelajari selengkapnya <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M14 7l5 5-5 5"></path></svg></a></article><article class="feature-card"><span class="feature-no">03</span><div class="feature-icon"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H8l-5 3 1-6a8 8 0 0 1-1-4V8a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h10a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v7Z"></path><path d="M8 10h8M8 14h5"></path></svg></div><h3>Direktori Pembeli &amp; Negosiasi</h3><p>Temukan calon pembeli, terima atau tolak penawaran, lalu negosiasi aman di aplikasi.</p><a>Pelajari selengkapnya <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M14 7l5 5-5 5"></path></svg></a></article></div></section><section id="harga" class="section prices-section"><div class="heading-row"><div><span class="kicker">HARGA PASAR TERKINI</span><h2>Pantau harga sebelum menjual</h2></div><button class="btn secondary">Lihat semua harga <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M14 7l5 5-5 5"></path></svg></button></div><div class="price-grid"><p class="empty-state" style="grid-column:1/-1;text-align:center;padding:24px">Belum ada data harga di database.</p></div></section><section class="section how"><div class="how-image"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1530507629858-e4977d30e9e0?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=crop&amp;fm=jpg&amp;q=85&amp;w=900" alt="Petani memanen padi"/><div class="photo-note"><b>Panen lebih pasti</b><span>Dengan pembeli yang sudah terhubung</span></div></div><div class="how-copy"><span class="kicker">CARA KERJA</span><h2>Dari lahan hingga pembeli, semudah 1—2—3</h2><div class="step"><span>1</span><div><h3>Daftar dan lengkapi profil</h3><p>Pilih peran sebagai petani atau pembeli, lalu verifikasi profil Anda.</p></div></div><div class="step"><span>2</span><div><h3>Pasang atau cari penawaran</h3><p>Petani mencatat hasil panen. Pembeli mencari sesuai kebutuhan.</p></div></div><div class="step"><span>3</span><div><h3>Sepakati transaksi</h3><p>Negosiasi aman di aplikasi dan selesaikan transaksi dengan jelas.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="keamanan" class="security"><div><span class="kicker light">KEPERCAYAAN &amp; KEAMANAN</span><h2>Bertransaksi dengan lebih tenang</h2><p>Identitas mitra diverifikasi, sumber harga selalu ditampilkan, dan percakapan tersimpan aman tanpa membagikan nomor pribadi.</p></div><div class="security-list"><span><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-3 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 7 8 10 8 10Z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-5"></path></svg> Verifikasi identitas mitra</span><span><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 7v6l4 2"></path></svg> Penanda usia data harga</span><span><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H8l-5 3 1-6a8 8 0 0 1-1-4V8a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h10a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v7Z"></path><path d="M8 10h8M8 14h5"></path></svg> Negosiasi aman di aplikasi</span></div></section><section class="closing"><span class="crop-icon"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21V4M12 7c-4 0-5-3-5-4 4 0 5 3 5 4ZM12 11c4 0 5-3 5-4-4 0-5 3-5 4ZM12 15c-4 0-5-3-5-4 4 0 5 3 5 4Z"></path></svg></span><h2>Siap menghubungkan panen Anda?</h2><p>Bergabung dengan pelaku pertanian Indonesia yang tumbuh bersama.</p><button class="btn white large">Mulai sekarang <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M14 7l5 5-5 5"></path></svg></button></section></main><footer><div class="logo light"><span class="logo-mark"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 4C12 4 5 8 5 15c0 3 2 5 5 5 7 0 10-8 10-16Z"></path><path d="M4 21c3-6 7-9 12-12"></path></svg></span><span>Tani<span>Hubungan</span></span></div><p>Menghubungkan petani dan pembeli lokal melalui informasi yang transparan.</p><div><a>Tentang Kami</a><a>Bantuan</a><a>Kebijakan Privasi</a></div><small>© 2025 TaniHubungan. Dibuat untuk pertanian Indonesia.</small></footer></div>
